Current Version can be found [[Rope Dog|here]].

Rope Dog was added in '''Beta 51.0''' as a 3G 4/4 with Charge, but the Magic of summoning an enemy [[Mace]] that would get killed at the end of that turn with Delay (triggering Mace's Dust on the Rope Dog that summoned it if it's still on the board). '''Beta 53.1''' gave it +2 ATK, but downgraded its Charge to Haste. '''Beta 56.0''' reworked the card, keeping its haste, but changing everything else. Its ATK and HP dropped by 2, and its cost increased by 1, bringing it down to a 4/4/2. Upon being played, it made you choose a Dog in your hand to give +1 ATK and +2 HP. It also gained a Synergy effect of turning into the chosen card with Haste and Rope Dog's stats before transforming.

